  "title": "Strand | Arbutus Terrace",
  "bodyText": "Portfolio\nAbout\nApproach\nTeam\nImpact\nHistory\nContact\nArbutus Terrace\nVancouver, BC\nNow Renting\n\nDiscover Arbutus Terrace, a boutique, pet-friendly rental community of 54 homes perfectly positioned on a prominent corner in Kitsilano at Arbutus Street and West 16th, directly alongside the Arbutus Greenway. As a new addition to Strand's The Westside Collection, Arbutus Terrace features curated local businesses on the ground floor including Vancouver favourite Cafe Artigiano. along with boutique cafes, shops, fitness studios and grocery markets just moments away. \n\nRENT NOW\nHomes\nAmenities\nGallery\nYOUR HOME\n\nOpen-concept layouts are thoughtfully planned to support both everyday living and easy entertaining. Durable flooring pairs modern style with long-lasting function, while kitchens feature contemporary cabinetry, sleek countertops, and high-quality appliances for a clean and cohesive finish. North-facing residences capture the city at its most iconic, a sightline framed by ocean and mountain vistas, while other homes are thoughtfully oriented toward the natural privacy of the Arbutus Greenway or the surrounding low-rise, tree-lined residential neighbourhoods.\n\nRENT NOW\nRENT ARBUTUS TERRACE\n\nEnjoy a thoughtfully curated collection of amenities. An expansive rooftop terrace offers a sauna, an outdoor kitchen with BBQ and sink, dedicated dining areas, comfortable social lounge seating, community garden plots, and a children’s play area, creating a welcoming space to gather, relax, and enjoy panoramic views. Complementing the rooftop experience is a versatile multi-use entertainment lounge, ideal for socializing, studying, or working remotely.\n\n1\nRooftop Terrace\n2\nSauna\n3\nDog Wash Station\n4\nSecure Package Parcel Lockers\n5\nChildren's Play Area\n6\nCommunity Garden Plots\n7\nEntertainment Lounge\nNEIGHBOURHOOD\n\nLife at Arbutus Terrace is effortless. From morning coffee runs downstairs to the ease of having quality local businesses seamlessly woven into where you live, daily life feels effortless. This connected rental community offers effortless access to Kerrisdale, Shaughnessy, South Granville, UBC, and downtown. Just beyond, the vibrant retail corridors of West 4th and West Broadway expand your options even further, offering an unmatched level of convenience.\n\n© Mapbox © OpenStreetMap Improve this map\nGALLERY\nVIEW MORE PROJECTS\nINFORMATION\nCareers\nCustomer Care\nContact\nThe Strand Collection\nStrand Contracting\nABOUT US\nApproach\nTeam\nImpact\nHistory\nCONNECT WITH US\ninfo@stranddev.com\nSTRAND\nSuite 2400 – 320 Granville Street\nVancouver, BC\nV6C 1S9\nPrivacy Policy\nTerms & Conditions\n© 2026 Strand",
